  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automated migration from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8",
    "splashDescription": "Are you ready to transition from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8? Exodus simplifies even the most complex migrations by ensuring seamless upgrades from Camunda 7 to Camunda 8. This guarantees reduced manual errors and accelerates upgrades with a 100% success rate every time. Additionally, Exodus offers a smarter approach to migration that saves both time and budget, making it a cost-effective solution for organizations that want to future-proof their process orchestration and automation architecture.",
